{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36191","headline":"胡中丞早梅 · 方干","name":"胡中丞早梅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不独闲花不共时，一株寒艳尚参差。\n凌晨未喷含霜朵，应候先开亚水枝。\n芬郁合将兰竝茂，凝明应与雪相宜。\n谢公吟赏愁飘落，可得更拈长笛吹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}